        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4$, $y=2$.",
          "worked": "The eight exclusive regions total 38:\n$$\\begin{align*}(18-2x)+2x+2+2+7+x+y+3&=38\\\\x+y&=6\\end{align*}$$\nOverseas total equals own state only:\n$$\\begin{align*}y+x+2+2&=18-2x\\\\3x+y&=14\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract the first equation from the second:\n$$\\begin{align*}2x&=8\\\\x&=4\\\\y&=6-4\\\\y&=2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 68
